{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Fotospots 是一張由你親手建立、逐步累積的攝影地圖，起初空無一物，之後隨著你站立過的位置與仍想前往的地點慢慢填滿，所有標記都出自你的記錄，保存得越久越有用。它適合喜歡拍照、習慣為光線與季節重訪同一地點的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自建個人攝影地點地圖</h2>\n<p>拍下照片的同時，應用會記錄你當時站立的位置與時間，並可補上光線、角度或路線的短註，再以霧氣、退潮、長焦等條件加上標籤。主畫面與鎖定畫面小工具顯示地點、城市與本月新增數量。未去過的地點可先加入願望清單，兩年前存下的位置透過 Spotlight 搜尋即可找回。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-129-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-130-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-131-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-132-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-133-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-134-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Fotospots: Find Photo Spots</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T23:58:06.706919+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}